# AI Agent environment variables
#
# Canonical template lives at the project root:
#   ../.env.example
#
# Docker Compose loads the root `.env` automatically — you do NOT need a
# separate ai-agent/.env file when running via `docker compose`.
#
# For local development (FastAPI outside Docker):
#   cp ../.env.example ../.env
#   # fill in LLM_PROVIDER + API key, set HIVE_HOST=localhost, etc.
